Conclusion: the box maximum attains the triangle bound up to 1/pi; parity forces only the sparse Lucas skeleton;
the explicit extremal constructions have a strictly negative defect rate (a larger domain), but even kernel moves
preserve fairness, parity and deadlines and restore |E|/S^d to a constant (rate O(1/d) -> 0) at any prescribed point,
at levels with any ratio d/m in (0, 0.59).  Hence no termwise majorant valid for all fair extractors can enlarge U_gamma.
